      "subtopic": "GDB 调试基础",
      "knowledgePoint": "检查表达式",
      "questionType": "代码与配置",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "GDB 的 print 命令通常用于什么？",
      "answer": "求值并显示当前上下文中的表达式。",
      "explanation": "可用它检查局部变量或简单表达式的值。",
      "example": "print count 查看当前帧中的 count。",
      "tags": [
        "GDB 调试基础",
        "检查表达式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/Expressions.html"
